OL,3,ATriathlete was 'very sick' in hospital
OL,4,Aafter swimming in 'dirty' open water
OL,5,
OL,6,FA triathlete who travels the world to
OL,7,Ftake part in races says making his
OL,8,Fdreams come true comes with serious
OL,9,Frisk after one event led to him being
OL,10,F"very sick" in hospital.
OL,12,FAndrew Jones, from Carmarthen, takes
OL,13,Fpart in various events, and has even
OL,14,Fearned a slot in the Ironman World
OL,15,FChampionship in Kona, Hawaii this
OL,16,Fmonth.
OL,18,FBut the triathlete said swimming in
OL,19,F"dirty" open-water made him very unwell
OL,20,Fahead of the event after he contracted
OL,21,FCampylobacter ` an infection caused by
OL,22,Fbacteria.
OL,23,APub: 04-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,311,300,200,140,0,100
