OL,3,ATriathlete was 'very sick' in hospital
OL,4,Aafter swimming in 'dirty' open water
OL,5,
OL,6,FTriathlon Cymru said its Safer Blue
OL,7,FSpaces project, which is the first of
OL,8,Fits kind, was now using small sampling
OL,9,Fdevices on triathletes to test the
OL,10,Fwater and provide reliable data on
OL,11,Fwater quality in Wales.
